@startuml
title Online shop
|Customer|
start
:Browse the catalogue;
repeat
  :Add an item to the cart;
repeat while (More items?) is (yes) not (no)
:Check out;
|#AntiqueWhite|Shop|
if (Payment accepted?) then (yes)
  fork
    :Pack the items;
  fork again
    :Send the confirmation email;
  end fork
else (no)
  |Customer|
  :Choose another payment method;
  stop
endif
|Warehouse|
:Hand over to the courier;
note right: Tracking number is emailed
stop
@enduml
